---
import Container from '@/components/ui/Container/Container.astro';
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';

const year = new Date().toLocaleDateString('de-CH', { year: 'numeric' });
---

<Layout
  seo={{
    title: 'About me',
    description: 'Read more about myself, my interests, and my qualifications.',
  }}
>
  <Container>
    <article>
      <p>
        My name is Sacha Schmid. I'm a front-end developer from Switzerland,
        interested in both interface design and web development.
      </p>
      <p>
        I graduated from <a
          href="https://fhnw.ch/en/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          University of Applied Sciences and Arts Northwestern Switzerland
        </a> in Brugg, Switzerland, majoring in Computer Science with a BSc.
      </p>
      <dl>
        <dt>Bachelor of Science FHNW in Computer Sciences</dt>
        <dd>2017 – Specialisation in design and management</dd>
        <dt>Federal Diploma of Vocational Education and Training</dt>
        <dd>2013 – Specialisation in application development</dd>
      </dl>
      <p>
        I have gathered experience in various aspects of front-end development
        and project management while working with companies and private clients
        alike, as well as a multitude of projects at university. You can see
        some of that work on my <a
          href="/projects"
          data-astro-prefetch
        >
          projects
        </a> page.
      </p>
      <dl>
        <dt>Topics</dt>
        <dd>
          UI design, UX design, interaction design, web development, iOS native
          development, project management, software architecture
        </dd>
      </dl>
      <p>
        I keep up to date with the latest trends and the rapid evolution of
        languages and tools as much as possible, trying out new technologies on
        projects all the time. This interest in the industry allows me to create
        websites and applications that not only build on foundational principles
        of design, but also use cutting-edge technology.
      </p>
      <dl>
        <dt>Languages</dt>
        <dd>HTML, CSS, JS, PHP, C#, Swift</dd>
        <dt>Tools, Frameworks, Libraries</dt>
        <dd>
          <a
            href="https://react.dev/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            React
          </a>, <a
            href="https://angular.dev/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Angular
          </a>, <a
            href="https://nextjs.org/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Next.js
          </a>, <a
            href="https://astro.build/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Astro
          </a>
        </dd>
      </dl>
      <p>
        Other than the web, I am very passionate about music, running, and
        photography. I like to go to concerts and festivals and just enjoy the
        music and the people around me.
      </p>
      <h2>About this site</h2>
      <p>
        This site was created with <a
          href="https://astro.build/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Astro
        </a>. It is hosted on <a
          href="https://github.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          GitHub Pages
        </a>. You can also view <a
          href=""
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          the site's source
        </a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        All content, unless otherwise noted, was created by Sacha Schmid.
        Copyright © 2013 – {year}.
      </p>
    </article>
  </Container>
</Layout>

<style>
  article {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding-block: 4.5rem;
    gap: 1.5rem;

    :global(:is(h1, h2, h3)) {
      margin-block-start: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
